		<skos:definition rdf:datatype="&rdf;langString" xml:lang="en">b located in c at some time =Def for some time t (b and c are independent continuants and not spatial regions, and the spatial region which b occupies at t is a (proper or improper) continuant part of the spatial region which c occupies at t)</skos:definition>
		<skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="&rdf;langString" xml:lang="en">located in at some time</skos:prefLabel>
