		<skos:altLabel rdf:datatype="&xs;string">ChuckInterlock.ManualUnclamp</skos:altLabel>
		<iof-av:directSource rdf:datatype="&xs;string">MTConnect Event ChuckInterlock.ManualUnclamp</iof-av:directSource>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">indication of the state of an operator controlled interlock that can inhibit the ability to initiate an unclamp action of an electronically controlled chuck.

When ChuckInterlockManualUnclamp is `ACTIVE`, it is expected that a chuck cannot be unclamped until ChuckInterlockManualUnclamp is set to `INACTIVE`.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:Class>
	
