		<iof-av:explanatoryNote rdf:datatype="&rdf;langString" xml:lang="en">Abstract: has no direct instances; every data item type is an instance of a subclass, such as Event, Sample, or Condition.</iof-av:explanatoryNote>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&rdf;langString" xml:lang="en">classifier that classifies MTConnect data items</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
