		<iof-av:directSource rdf:datatype="&xs;string">MTConnect Event EquipmentMode.Powered</iof-av:directSource>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">indication that primary power is applied to the piece of equipment and, as a minimum, the controller or logic portion of the piece of equipment is powered and functioning or components that are required to remain on are
powered.

Example: Heaters for an extrusion machine that required to be powered even when the equipment is turned off.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:Class>
	
