		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">indication that a piece of equipment is performing any activity, the equipment is active and performing a function under load or not.

Example: For traditional machine tools, this includes when the piece of equipment is `LOADED`, making rapid moves, executing a tool change, etc.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:Class>
	
