		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">time that a piece of equipment is performing any activity the equipment is active and performing a function under load or not.

Example: For traditional machine tools, this includes `LOADED`, plus rapid moves, tool changes, etc.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:Class>
	
