		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">leaf component composed of an electromechanical actuator that produces deflection of a beam of light or energy in response to electric current through its coil in a magnetic field.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:Class>
	
