		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">data reported for a data item is provided on a periodic basis. The `PERIOD` for reporting data is defined in the value of the filter.

The value of filter **MUST** be an absolute value reported in seconds representing the time between reported samples of the value of the data item.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
