		<iof-av:directSource rdf:datatype="&xs;string">MTConnect Component Spindle</iof-av:directSource>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">component that provides an axis of rotation for the purpose of rapidly rotating a part or a tool to provide sufficient surface speed for cutting operations.

spindle was **DEPRECATED** in *MTConnect Version 1.1* and was replaced by rotary mode.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:Class>
	
