	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&mtc-cnstr;ToolLifeEnum_PARTCOUNT">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&mtc-cnstr;ToolLifeEnum"/>
		<rdfs:label rdf:datatype="&xs;string">PART_COUNT</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/"/>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">tool life measured in parts. 

All units for minimum, maximum, and nominal **MUST** be provided as the number of parts.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&mtc-cnstr;ToolLifeEnum_WEAR">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&mtc-cnstr;ToolLifeEnum"/>
		<rdfs:label rdf:datatype="&xs;string">WEAR</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/"/>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">tool life measured in tool wear. 

Wear **MUST** be provided in millimeters as an offset to nominal. All units for minimum, maximum, and nominal **MUST** be given as millimeter offsets as
well. The standard will only consider dimensional wear at this time.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
