	</owl:DatatypeProperty>
	
	<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="&mtc-cnstr;hasConditionIdValue">
		<rdfs:label rdf:datatype="&xs;string">has condition id value</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="&mtc-cnstr;ConditionObservation"/>
		<rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/ObservationInformationModel/"/>
		<rdfs:range rdf:resource="&xs;string"/>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">identifier of an individual {{term(condition activation)}} provided by a piece of equipment.

{{property(Condition::conditionId)}} **MUST** be unique for all concurrent {{termpl(condition activation)}}.

{{property(Condition::conditionId)}} **MUST** be maintained for all state transitions related to the same {{term(condition activation)}}.

Multiple {{property(Condition::conditionId)}}s **MAY** exist for the same {{property(nativeCode)}}.

If {{property(Condition::conditionId)}} is not given, the value is the {{property(Condition::nativeCode)}}. If {{property(Condition::nativeCode)}} and {{property(Condition::conditionId)}} are not given, {{property(Condition::conditionId)}} **MUST** be generated.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:DatatypeProperty>
	
