		<rdfs:range rdf:resource="&xs;string"/>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">time-period over which the data was collected.

{{property(Sample::duration)}} **MUST** be provided when the {{property(DataItem::statistic)}} is defined in the {{term(MTConnectDevices Response Document)}}.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:DatatypeProperty>
	
	<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="&mtc-cnstr;hasEntryDefinition">
