&gt; Note: `Item` defined in ASME Y14.100 - A nonspecific term used to denote any unit or product, including materials, parts, assemblies, equipment, accessories, and computer software.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:DatatypeProperty>
	
	<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="&mtc-cnstr;hasKeyType">
