		<rdfs:range rdf:resource="&xs;integer"/>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">number representing the sequential position of an occurrence of an {{term(observation)}} in the data buffer of an {{term(agent)}}.

{{property(Observation::sequence)}} **MUST** have a value represented as an unsigned 64-bit value from 1 to $$ 2^{64}-1 $$.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:DatatypeProperty>
	
