		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition rdf:datatype="&xs;string">element which identifies the road or part of a road or other access route along which a delivery point can be accessed, either directly or via a secondary or tertiary road or access route.</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
	</owl:DatatypeProperty>
	
